"after a sufficient period via \"Reproduction\" ← \"Pregnancy\" ← \"+ New "
"pregnancy diagnosis\" to confirm pregnancy (manual exam or sonar) — if "
"confirmed, the expected birth date is calculated automatically from the "
"gestation duration set in settings."

